{"lines":[{"w":0.1214721934000651,"h":0.01626736311805832,"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.06962794633311864,"c":1,"x":0.098728923765384974},{"y":0.11326134955295719,"c":1,"w":0.79027608235677094,"t":"So what are the implications here for humans? Well, because many birds are migratory, they Q37","h":0.017422190824582739,"x":0.10074596754934485},{"c":1,"h":0.01773069828783802,"t":"may be transporting mercury far from contaminated sites. For example, it's been found that","y":0.1282725619204329,"w":0.72448532104492191,"x":0.10071851210904584},{"w":0.74074076334635419,"c":1,"h":0.0145451559194828,"t":"ducks who'd been feeding at a contaminated site were later shot by hunters over a thousand.","x":0.10082303408409814,"y":0.14534883707219826},{"t":"kilometres away, and presumably eaten. But these birds likely had mercury levels high","x":0.10072740559462469,"w":0.68537409464518229,"y":0.16005993282400588,"h":0.016766447060520995,"c":1},{"x":0.10280585591368833,"w":0.41371350606282548,"h":0.014072144129812614,"c":1,"t":"enough to warrant concern for human consumption.","y":0.17654119386287148},{"t":"In addition, going back to song learning by birds, we saw that this may be affected by","c":1,"h":0.019056419040064387,"x":0.10071571835506689,"y":0.19796733223946905,"w":0.6771767171223958},{"x":0.10073604090761355,"y":0.2135733850172723,"w":0.72858261108398437,"c":1,"h":0.018030581120467404,"t":"mercury contamination. Well, we also know that in humans, mercury causes developmental"},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"x":0.85390946563097958,"y":0.21366279053651605,"w":0.037037035624186254,"t":"Q38"},{"h":0.016985129973071222,"x":0.10074518326197988,"y":0.22958690644716939,"c":1,"w":0.69356770833333337,"t":"delays in the acquisition of language, and in fact this process is very similar in the brain"},{"t":"regions it involves and even the genes that are involved. But mercury contamination has","c":1,"h":0.017884065742627464,"w":0.69983759562174486,"x":0.10275673372838771,"y":0.24401877318574772},{"x":0.10076653395186289,"c":1,"t":"other important implications for humans as well. It's now known that an unborn child can be","y":0.26034242340316527,"w":0.72848871866861986,"h":0.016224362403680859},{"x":0.85390946563097958,"t":"Q39","w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.26017441844349276,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"h":0.016696114422154462,"x":0.10076085835053011,"w":0.73880411783854161,"c":1,"y":0.275487427956846,"t":"affected if the food eaten by its mother contains high levels of mercury, and these effects can"},{"w":0.16499626159667968,"t":"be quite substantial.","y":0.29324313844472027,"x":0.10262352042720181,"h":0.015327442942013825,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.31391511417869666,"t":"In the end, it comes down to whether more value is placed on human economic wellbeing","x":0.10487355926212406,"w":0.7079790242513021,"h":0.016430755947728581},{"w":0.714157969156901,"h":0.01775362241675349,"x":0.10278015203783639,"c":1,"t":"or environmental wellbeing. It's true there are new regulations for mercury emissions from","y":0.32906341025948949},{"x":0.85596707858342291,"c":1,"t":"Q40","y":0.32994186030668315,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"y":0.3438423710510955,"x":0.10273493785950014,"w":0.69572041829427078,"t":"power plants, but these will need billions of dollars to implement, and increase costs for","c":1,"h":0.018628941548305966},{"h":0.018165937722501635,"t":"everyone. Some argue that's too much to pay to protect wildlife. But as we've seen, the","x":0.10281402164908561,"c":1,"y":0.3599464405307724,"w":0.69354008992513017},{"t":"issues go beyond that, and I think it's an issue we need to consider very carefully.","y":0.37577532249718182,"x":0.10282521085264468,"w":0.65030690511067712,"h":0.015794347396868469,"c":1},{"h":0.014813091224158192,"c":1,"x":0.42588527789550162,"w":0.09884672800699873,"y":0.43445391920239773,"t":"TEST 8"},{"x":0.10493827354195356,"w":0.15432098388671872,"y":0.4955830387763841,"h":0.016044868316470673,"t":"SECTION 1","c":1},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"t":"ВОB:","c":1,"w":0.034979422887166337,"x":0.10493827197680304,"y":0.52761627895785623},{"t":"MARGARET:","y":0.54191956584491607,"c":1,"w":0.082416744232177735,"h":0.010637612449547085,"x":0.10488216282618604},{"c":1,"x":0.20361343600663559,"w":0.39728266398111978,"t":"Hello, Pembroke Cycling Holidays, Bob speaking.","y":0.52244759578866717,"h":0.017002843715276827},{"t":"Oh hello. I've seen your advert for people to lead cycle trips. Are you the right","w":0.6153996276855469,"y":0.53734509582334145,"c":1,"h":0.016975560092813646,"x":0.20567499875747614},{"t":"person to speak to?","y":0.55436142075013262,"h":0.016225536243092753,"x":0.20534796719780152,"w":0.15939764658610028,"c":1},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.57412790686930537,"w":0.032921810150146502,"c":1,"t":"ВОВ:","x":0.10699588493864418},{"c":1,"y":0.58853731220815342,"w":0.080309918721516924,"t":"MARGARET:","x":0.10696438213588276,"h":0.010425375544140247},{"t":"ВОВ:","y":0.60465116268667851,"w":0.03497942288716635,"x":0.10699588516135511,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1},{"t":"MARGARET:","c":1,"y":0.61953377206484506,"h":0.0096792102000458069,"w":0.080614388783772778,"x":0.10681703286497227},{"h":0.018612438714125101,"x":0.20352914685187565,"y":0.56822608721913692,"c":1,"w":0.35021031697591154,"t":"Yes, I am. Could I have your name, please?"},{"t":"It's Margaret Smith.","c":1,"x":0.20346985807623022,"w":0.15896100362141927,"y":0.58430291559329617,"h":0.016070824208613388},{"h":0.014550291607320909,"c":1,"t":"Are you looking for a permanent job, Margaret?","x":0.20576132330628136,"y":0.60029069752361597,"w":0.37654319763183597},{"x":0.20781895542390696,"t":"No. temporary. I've got a permanent job starting in a few months' time, and I","y":0.6133686688212141,"w":0.60082300821940104,"h":0.01599179561062325,"c":1},{"t":"want to do something else until then.","x":0.2057613143401171,"w":0.29423868815104159,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"y":0.63221436958864718},{"x":0.10493827081558792,"t":"ВОВ:","y":0.64970930218475198,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.039094651540120443},{"y":0.66558377143709291,"t":"MARGARET:","h":0.01185571290859766,"c":1,"x":0.10490710632542838,"w":0.084424470265706375},{"y":0.6467149873416449,"x":0.20353049459670358,"t":"What work do you do?","w":0.18351577758789062,"c":1,"h":0.01570738106088454},{"w":0.58040817260742195,"y":0.66093423465832157,"t":"This will probably sound crazy - I used to be a lawyer, and then I made a","x":0.20568655659025362,"c":1,"h":0.017164261798836233},{"w":0.5884773763020833,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"y":0.67726737342115806,"t":"complete career change and I'm going to be a doctor. I've just finished my","x":0.20576131206125184},{"c":1,"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.10905349831425161,"y":0.71220930221367018,"t":"ВОВ:","w":0.034979422887166337},{"x":0.10696312582778636,"w":0.082370045979817702,"t":"MARGARET:","h":0.010442303544079268,"y":0.72661024345179615,"c":1},{"x":0.1090534983365094,"y":0.77470930221995926,"w":0.03497942288716635,"c":1,"t":"ВОВ:","h":0.008720930389296444},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"t":"MARGARET:","x":0.10905349832653154,"y":0.83575581386149278,"w":0.080246912638346365},{"x":0.10696927154054146,"y":0.86623664850212834,"c":1,"t":"ВОВ:","w":0.037090263366699225,"h":0.011712749377858378},{"w":0.080520013173421237,"y":0.89695056110834304,"t":"MARGARET:","c":1,"x":0.10894627607735903,"h":0.0096259178907486254},{"h":0.016841572221232615,"w":0.50224349975585936,"t":"Right. And have you had any experience of leading cycle trips?","x":0.20568130884911076,"y":0.70780544947958024,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.62370203653971357,"t":"Yes, I've led several bike tours in Africa. The trip to India that I had arranged to","x":0.20565315197894962,"h":0.019484963658560894,"y":0.72199048091554185},{"t":"lead next month has now been cancelled, so when I saw you were advertising","x":0.20576131557694205,"c":1,"y":0.73837209321203823,"w":0.62139918009440098,"h":0.014572547377910916},{"y":0.75436046530506129,"c":1,"t":"for tour leaders, I decided to apply.","w":0.2798353830973308,"h":0.014534882858869502,"x":0.20781893362280238},{"t":"OK. Now we normally have two or three leaders on a trip, depending on the size","x":0.20979312395009156,"y":0.76877763585055503,"w":0.63393137613932293,"h":0.016822777872793293,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.20781892747258127,"w":0.62757202148437508,"t":"of the group. Some tours are for very experienced cyclists, but we've got a tour","y":0.78474676069416571,"h":0.01472320376914027},{"c":1,"x":0.20772731101540501,"h":0.016456325427663065,"t":"coming up soon in Spain, which is proving so popular we need an additional","y":0.79967104317244919,"w":0.60720748901367194},{"t":"leader. It's a cycling holiday for families. Would that suit you?","h":0.014552004064912638,"x":0.20781894096479447,"c":1,"w":0.48353907267252605,"y":0.81684334489868671},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"y":0.83127208487633608,"w":0.63580245971679694,"x":0.20576132158885543,"c":1,"t":"It certainly would. I enjoy working with children, and I probably need some more"},{"x":0.2098765374742976,"c":1,"t":"experience before I go on a really challenging trip.","y":0.84738372080261615,"w":0.3991769663492839,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"w":0.58655685424804682,"c":1,"x":0.20981021528110319,"y":0.86146990224015918,"h":0.016115480092725898,"t":"That tour includes several teenagers: have you worked with that age group"},{"x":0.2076777601748489,"t":"Yes, I'm a volunteer worker in a youth club, where I help people to improve their","y":0.89083505316289235,"c":1,"w":0.63609466552734384,"h":0.019928663723319917},{"w":0.63797159830729167,"c":1,"h":0.01668409183533659,"x":0.20775120626612267,"t":"cycling skills. Before that I helped out in a cycling club where I taught beginners.","y":0.90787881078925392},{"w":0.072380059560140042,"h":0.014118877541190455,"t":"Example","c":1,"y":0.58378358438440292,"x":0.85784289146174875},{"w":0.026748971939086985,"t":"Q1","x":0.85802469089259636,"h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.59883720911936489,"c":1},{"w":0.026748971939086874,"c":1,"y":0.67732558124240705,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.86008230404245944,"t":"Q2"},{"x":0.1090534971723266,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.94331395333234358,"w":0.039094651540120456,"c":1,"t":"110"},{"x":0.39471442585841338,"h":0.017806331737864278,"w":0.2085117212931315,"y":0.96641811852927229,"c":1,"t":"leltsresources.org"}],"w":2400,"h":3395}